'''Quadity Assurance''' is a conglomeration of clanless players that joined ranks for [[EQL Season 22]].

Quadity Assurance is the ultimate fusion of two legendary forces, [[The Suicide Quad]] and [[Peppes Bodega]], born out of necessity and forged by skill. United under a single banner, they combine raw aggression with strategic precision, mastering the chaotic energy of the arena. With the power of the Quad coursing through their veins, they strike with unmatched fury, ensuring that every battle is not just a victory—but a guarantee. 

